OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners spend thousands on
OL,4,Achemical pollution tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners calling for action on
OL,7,Fchemical contamination at a former RAF
OL,8,Fbase said they have spent more than
OL,9,F#10,000 on independent testing.
OL,11,FGallos Brook Community Group said it
OL,12,Fhas carried out more than 14 tests near
OL,13,FRAF Upper Heyford, which show unsafe
OL,14,Flevels of polyfluoroalkyl substances
OL,15,F(PFAS), referred to as forever
OL,16,Fchemicals.
OL,18,FGroup member Helen Christie said the
OL,19,Ftesting was done by "a group of mums",
OL,20,Fadding: "The authorities should be
OL,21,Ftaking responsibility for it."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
