OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners spend thousands on
OL,4,Achemical pollution tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has
OL,7,Fpreviously stated there was a risk of
OL,8,Fcontamination at the site from historic
OL,9,Ffire fighting activities and has
OL,10,Fconducted its own testing as part of an
OL,11,FEngland-wide PFAS monitoring programme.
